            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis is an expected behavior because these clues come from mapping descriptions, as they are [always preferred](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/79654ef28182986dcdd9e2d3506d1728fc7c4f79/doc/mini-clue.txt#L76-L79) over custom clues. To make it more informative, either:\n- Use [`set_mapping_desc()`](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/79654ef28182986dcdd9e2d3506d1728fc7c4f79/doc/mini-clue.txt#L630) to adjust description manually.\n- Make PR to neovim/neovim for these mappings to have more informative descriptions (doubt it will be merged).",
